#: ../../openmvcam/shields/proto-shield.rst:2
#: ../../openmvcam/shields/proto-shield.rst:6
msgid "Proto Shield"
msgstr "Proto Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/proto-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Proto Shield gives the OpenMV Cam a 10x10 through-hole prototyping area "
"with 3.3 V and GND rails tied to the camera, plus broken-out I/O pins for "
"soldering on custom circuits."
msgstr ""
"Proto Shield poskytuje OpenMV Cam prototypovací plochu 10x10 s průchozími "
"otvory a s napájecími větvemi 3,3 V a GND propojenými s kamerou, plus "
"vyvedené I/O piny pro pájení vlastních obvodů."

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/proto-shield.rst:6
msgid ".. image:: ../proto-shield-hero.jpg"
msgstr ".. image:: ../proto-shield-hero.jpg"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/proto-shield.rst:11
msgid ""
"For full datasheet, photos, and ordering see the `Proto Shield product page "
"<https://openmv.io/products/proto-shield>`_."
msgstr ""
"Úplný datasheet, fotografie a možnosti objednání najdete na `stránce "
"produktu Proto Shield <https://openmv.io/products/proto-shield>`_\\ ."

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/proto-shield.rst:15
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Hlavní vlastnosti"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/proto-shield.rst:17
msgid "10x10 through-hole prototyping grid"
msgstr "Prototypovací mřížka 10x10 s průchozími otvory"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/proto-shield.rst:18
msgid "3.3 V and GND power rails tied to the OpenMV Cam"
msgstr "Napájecí větve 3,3 V a GND propojené s OpenMV Cam"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/proto-shield.rst:19
msgid "Broken-out OpenMV Cam I/O pins"
msgstr "Vyvedené I/O piny OpenMV Cam"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/proto-shield.rst:20
msgid "Solder on accelerometers, sensors, or LED circuits"
msgstr "Pájení akcelerometrů, senzorů nebo LED obvodů"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/proto-shield.rst:23
msgid "Pinout"
msgstr "Pinout"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/proto-shield.rst:25
msgid "Proto Shield Pinout"
msgstr "Pinout Proto Shieldu"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/proto-shield.rst:25
msgid ".. image:: ../pinout-proto-shield.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../pinout-proto-shield.png"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/proto-shield.rst:29
msgid ""
"Every header pin is broken out unconnected to the prototyping grid for the "
"user to wire as they like. The 3.3 V and GND rails are tied through to the "
"camera so soldered-on circuits can be powered directly."
msgstr ""
"Každý pin konektoru je nezapojen vyveden k prototypovací mřížce, aby si jej "
"uživatel zapojil podle libosti. Větve 3,3 V a GND jsou propojeny ke kameře, "
"takže připájené obvody lze napájet přímo."

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/proto-shield.rst:34
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Použití"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/proto-shield.rst:36
msgid ""
"Whatever you wire to the prototyping grid is driven through whichever "
"peripheral API fits — GPIO, PWM, ADC, I²C, SPI, UART, and so on. As a simple"
